title: infomeasure-rs
abstract: |
  High-performance Rust library for information-theoretic measures
  including entropy, mutual information, transfer entropy, and the
  Kullback-Leibler and Jensen-Shannon divergences, with multiple estimation
  approaches (discrete, kernel, ordinal, exponential family).

